      "writtenOn": "2022-07-12T15:24:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Allow off/on for sniffers (1) for long running callers like the simulator, (2) to let developers better isolate the sniff data.\n\nIn that case HciSniffer was a good API approach, passing around outputStream that if null disables sniffing.\n\nvoid HciSniffer::SetOutputStream(std::shared_ptr\u003cstd::ostream\u003e outputStream)",
      "revId": "255de6785d20e495ed9ff92b90454ddde95ce0ed",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
