        "id": 1881539
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-07-12T15:44:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is already available by default as you just need to add/remove the BaseBandSniffer from your TestModel to enable and disable it.\n\nFor the HciSniffer the `SetOutputStream` was added because we had a chicken and egg problem where we wanted to put the Bluetooth Device Address in the name of the file but to get the address we need to have the transport.",
      "parentUuid": "d23d6f03_94b2379e",
      "revId": "255de6785d20e495ed9ff92b90454ddde95ce0ed",
